## 6. CI: main 13ad8a61 (merge of #341) run 42583164931 attempt 1 FAILED in job test (129046532264) — root cause PROVEN
log: 08:03:19Z "urllib.error.HTTPError: HTTP Error 504: Gateway Time-out" -> "RuntimeError: downloading the pinned k6 failed (HTTPError)"
  in step `python scripts/r176_load_framework.py --ensure-k6` (ci.yml:58), before any test ran. Downstream jobs skipped (not counted). The same tree passed on PR #341.
  Attempt 2 re-run requested once (failed jobs only); attempt 1 stays recorded as failed.
cause: the upstream returned 504 and ensure_k6 had no retry at all (single urlretrieve).
fix: scripts/r176_load_framework.py _download_with_retry — retry ONLY transient errors (HTTP 429/500/502/503/504, TimeoutError/socket.timeout), 4 attempts,
  delays 2/4/8 s. Permanent errors (404/403) and the pytest network guard (R-072, RuntimeError) are NOT retried. The SHA256 check is unchanged.
